								<orm:Body>For each Vehicle and Day, that Vehicle was sold on Day if and only if that Vehicle is owned by some User that possibly lives in some TimeZone1 and some Record is of that Vehicle and that Record is an Event that was at some Moment and possibly that Event happened in some TimeZone2 and that Event is an Income that is a CarSale and Day is the date of that Moment in TimeZone2, or TimeZone1 where there is none.</orm:Body>
